== Reward ==

* [[Gnome Shaped Cookie]]
* [[Holiday Gift]]

== Walkthrough ==

You say, 'Hail, Merry Snowgleam'

: Merry Snowgleam says, 'Have you noticed? Half our decorations are gone! Someone's stolen the garlands, the tinsel, even the snow globes!'

You say, 'Who stole it?'

: Merry Snowgleam says, 'It wasn't the wind, no no no. I heard them — high-pitched giggles and the clatter of tiny boots! Goblins! They're down in their miserable tunnels hoarding Frostmas joy like it's gold! Would you [help] recover it'

You say, 'I will help recover it.'

: Merry Snowgleam says, 'Wonderful! The goblins probably thought our ornaments were magical gems. Look for Frostmas Baubles in Runnyeye Citadel — they should sparkle even down there. Bring me three, and we'll brighten Frostmas again!'

Collect three [[Frostmas Baubles]] from goblins in [[Runnyeye Citadel]] and turn them in to [[Merry Snowgleam]]

: Merry Snowgleam twirls and hangs one mid-air and exclaims, 'Oh! You found them! I can smell the peppermint polish still on them. Bless you! Now the camp will sparkle again — and I'll have words with those goblins later. For now, take this — a token of laughter restored.'

You receive a [[Gnome Shaped Cookie]] and a [[Holiday Gift]].

